+| Normal inserted-row path | `insertedRowsUseTheRowDelegate` (Qt 5 and Qt 6) | PASS |
+| Model-clearing failure path | `clearingModelIsSafe` (`setModel(nullptr)`) | PASS |
+| Keyboard with no model | `tabAndBacktabWithoutModelAreSafe` | PASS |
+| Keyboard after clearing the model | `tabAndBacktabAfterClearingModelAreSafe` | PASS |
+| Local configured build (Qt 6.12) | `cmake --build build --target RowTableViewTest`, `ctest -R '^RowTableViewTest$'` from `build/tests` | build **EXIT=0**, ctest **EXIT=0**, 1/1 test executed |
+| Audio thread | not touched — test-only source change | n/a |
+
+The regression is deterministic and compile-time/platform-level: no clock, sleeps, threads, races or injected
+timestamps. The same source is compiled by both Qt 5 and Qt 6 CI legs; the Qt 5 leg is the one that catches a
+reintroduced unguarded Qt-6-only call.
